<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hēsĭŏnē</span></b> ,
			ēs, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hēsĭŏna</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡσιόνη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A daughter of Laomedon</i>, <i>king of
				Troy</i>, <i>whom Hercules rescued from a
				seamonster and gave in marriage to Telamon</i>, <i>to whom she bore Teucer</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
				11, 211 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 8, 157</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
				31</span></i>; <i><span class="en">89</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">97</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The title of a tragedy of Nœvius</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 7, § 107</span></i>
			Müll.; <i><span class="en">Gell. 10, 25, 3</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
